>> title: Crepes
>> category: Flatbreads & Pancakes
>> tags: french, batter, breakfast, skillet
>> servings: 12
>> time: 1 hr 20 min
>> step.4: swirl thin in a buttered pan, 1 min per side

Blend @whole milk{1 1/4%cup}(300 mL), @water{1/4%cup}(60 mL), @eggs{3%large}(150 g), @sugar{1%Tbsp}(12 g), and @fine sea salt{1/4%tsp}(1.5 g) until smooth.

Blend @&(~1)liquid{} with @all-purpose flour{1%cup}(130 g), @melted unsalted butter{3%Tbsp}(42 g).

Rest @&(~1)batter{} covered ~{1%hr} so the gluten relaxes.

Swirl @&(~1)batter{} thin in a #crepe pan{} filmed with @butter for the pan{2%Tbsp}(28 g), ~{1%min} per side.
